Set cell 0, 1 of inputs to 6.
Set cell 1, 0 of inputs to 1.
Set cell 1, 1 of inputs to 3.

Create tensor activations with dimensions 2, 2.
Multiply tensor weights by tensor inputs into activations.

Get cell 0, 0 of activations into c00.
